WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.030
Video can instantly help your ad stand out, so let's look at how to use the sponsored Brands video

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:05.560
ad format.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:11.178
When you're setting up your campaign, pick your ad format as video, you'll pick one product to advertise,

00:00:11.178 --> 00:00:13.160
and go down to the creative section.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.180
Add a short video that showcases your product in action.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:20.600
You can see video requirements and guidance to help pass moderation right from here.

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:25.285
Once your video finishes uploading, you'll see a preview of your ad on the right, and it's time

00:00:25.285 --> 00:00:27.280
to move on to the rest of your campaign.
